{c: Verse 1}
Hey [C#m]eththanai santhosam,        [C#m]Dhinamum kottuthu unmela
Nee [G#]manasu vachuputta Rasikka,        [G#]mudiyum unnaala
Nee [C#m]sindhura kanneerum Inga,        [F#m]nerantharam illa
Idhu [G#]purinjikittaalae,        [G#]Ingae neethanda Aala
